Package: scReportR
Title: Single-Cell RNAseq Analysis Report Generator
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Your", "Name", email = "your@email.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Provides a standardised workflow for single-cell RNAseq analysis,
    including QC, preprocessing, normalisation, integration, clustering,
    and automatic annotation. Generates a self-contained Quarto report
    from a single params.yml configuration file.
